ass="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/smart-toolz/">Explore Smart Tools →</a></div></aside></div></div></main></div></div><?php include __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?><script src="/learning-hub/assets/js/app.js"></script><script src="/learning-hub/assets/js/router.js"></script>